Modifications in this fork (2026-11-18):

  1. Replace the retired 2020 Mi Home iOS User-Agent with a currently
     supported Android one, fixing "-127 client withdraw" on every
     api.io.mi.com request.
  2. Treat -127 / "client withdraw" as an auth failure so the client
     re-logs in and retries instead of giving up.
  3. Honour the server-provided wait_second before retrying after -127.
  4. Only run the python micoapi helper when a xiaomiio session already
     exists, so it cannot kick the freshly obtained token.
  5. Add a fallback login path: complete xiaomiio login to obtain a
     passToken, then exchange it for a micoapi token.

